<title>UK: Petrobras to launch $250 mln bond - sources.</title>
<headline>Petrobras to launch $250 mln bond - sources.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Petroleo Brasileiro SA -- the Brazilian state oil company Petrobras -- will launch a $250 million Eurobond next week, sources close to the deal said on Friday.</p>
<p>The bond is expected to be issued in two tranches -- one maturing after five years with an expected spread of 250 to 270 basis points over U.S. Treasury notes, the other maturing after 10 years with talk of a 340 to 360 b.p. spread.</p>
<p>Each bond is expected to be for $125 million.</p>
<p>Chase Manhattan International is the sole lead manager for the transaction.</p>
<p>-- Hayley Pienaar, London Newsroom +44 171 542 7718</p>
</text>
